  "query_preview": "/FRIDAY NIGHT THROUGH WEDNESDAY/...\nIssued at 1229 AM MDT Thu Jul 23 2026\n\nThis Weekend Onwards...\n\nAs the upper high moves overhead, flow weakens aloft. Forcing for \nstorms will significantly weaken, though recycling monsoon moisture \nwill be plentiful enough to keep afternoon showers and storms going \nover the mountains. Meanwhile, the plains will dry out again, with \ntriple-digit temperatures returning. Current long-range guidance \nsuggests a wetter and potentially cooler (or at least less hot) \npattern as we move into next week.",
